 ## Background
-The method was introduced in "Efficient Unbiased Volume Path Tracing on the GPU" [S1, book]. It builds on the principles of Hierarchical DDA Traversal [17026-hierarchical-dda-traversal.md] and adapts them for volume rendering by integrating delta tracking and adaptive mip selection. The approach was inspired by techniques used in screen-space reflections [S1, book].
